たせいで、生真面目。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"曲がった事が許せない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の新一とは許婚の間柄であり、恋人の間柄でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、性的な接触は一切していない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あくまで、結婚するまでお預けというスタンス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"故に、処女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92448"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d7d784f0adb16903f6b1788b6fe9a2cb6dfef3b0d6f6a19eacb0995a30ac752f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c3/c334c104f37bd21217cc4f4a04a4d1185d5bb2b88f56efac3364b5af93bf8a77.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西口有香","creatorId":"vndb:s24","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s24","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s24","name":"西口 有香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:28950:92448:6592:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c35511","characterName":"小平 正義","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"213301","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"28950"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11380"],"vndbCharacterId":"c35511"},"originalCharacterName":"小平 正義","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The one who stole the protagonist's girl. Even though he used to be top-ranked student, he stopped coming to school and started working part-time at construction site due to family circumstance. He got earnest side despite his rough looking and rudeness."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35511"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園3年生。不良。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"喧嘩っぱやく、強い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"バリバリのヤンキーだが、モロヤンという感じではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今風の悪いヤツ。"},{"spoiler":false,"tex